{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>And your little ones, etc.</b> Since He said, ״כַּאֲשֶׁר דִּבַּרְתֶּם בְּאָזְנָי כֵּן אֶעֱשֶׂה לָכֶם״ — and they also spoke evil about their little ones — therefore HaShem came and excluded them from the general rule and said, ״וְטַפְּכֶם וְגוֹ׳ וְהֵבֵאתִי״ etc. And He said <b>and I will bring them</b> with an added vav, to say: not only will they not be for spoil, but furthermore they will have a benefit, that HaShem will bring them into the land, etc."], :book :numbers, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T20:09:25.289848703Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}